mness, but I want to highlight Candidate B as a strong alternative due to conscientiousness and stress handling, though his uncooperative attitude is a drawback.\" Then we can ask a question to Agent 1 about A's reliability or D's leadership.\n\nWe need to ask a tool call before public message if we need missing info. Perhaps we want to know if Candidate D's leadership is sufficient for cockpit. We have note: D has relatively weak leadership skills. That's enough. Maybe we want to know about A's reliability. We have note: A can be unorganized, which suggests reliability concerns. So we have enough.\n\nThus we can produce a public message: agree with C but bring up B as alternative, compare, and state we still recommend C but need to discuss further.\n\nWe must include metadata vote: Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
